  "prompt": "Repaint this existing Orange SMP Kitchen item as a native 16x16 vanilla Minecraft item sprite, matching the pixel density of vanilla items like wheat seeds, sugar and bread. Same subject: A warm paper seed packet with a folded green seal, a coffee sprig bearing ripe red cherries, and two roasted-brown coffee seeds. Crisp stepped edges and connected upper-left lighting keep the crop readable in inventory. Keep the original palette and silhouette, simplified to 16x16: clean dark outline, upper-left lighting, 2-3 shade steps per material, no noise or dithering, no letters, transparent background. Drop details that cannot stay legible at 16x16.",
